{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10115120","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10115120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011513001:":{"text":"It's Elona!","source_cn":"是艾洛娜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F555E66B2E28DB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011513002:":{"text":"And a message leaf from Bryon...","source_cn":"布莱恩捎来一封叶信……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x911DA8A62232B1B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1011513003:":{"text":"He wants us to meet him at the dock!","source_cn":"让我们去前面的码头找他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11C18A2BD5B8F6FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1011512001:1":{"text":"Curses! Why would Eomir want to corrupt the Lucent Tree?!","source_cn":"可恶……可恶！为什么想腐化流荧树的人是伊米尔？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC118DC91D9888044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1011512002:0":{"text":"He no longer deserves to be called a sage!","source_cn":"做出伤害丛林的事，他已经不配被称为贤者了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB40047641E9D90D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1011512003:0":{"text":"Parisa, are you alright?","source_cn":"帕瑞莎……你还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6C04B8AC8BA64FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1011512004:0":{"text":"Please give me some time to come to terms with this...","source_cn":"……给我一些时间，让我试着接受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D163CC039692917","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1011512005:0":{"text":"Of course.","source_cn":"好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC180104A3CF2B88D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1011512006:0":{"text":"Magister, your guess was correct. The corrupted roots underground here are spreading to the <style=\"highlight\">north</style>!","source_cn":"主人，您猜的没错……这里地下的腐化，向<style=h...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D97134E3FC34388","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, your guess was correct. The corrupted roots underground here are spreading to the <style=\"highlight\">north</style>!","female":"Magister, your guess was correct. The corrupted roots underground here are spreading to the <style=\"highlight\">north</style>!","variant_male_record_index":"108295","variant_female_record_index":"108296","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1011512006":{"text":"Magister, your guess was correct. The corrupted roots underground here are spreading to the <style=\"highlight\">north</style>!","source_cn":"主人，您猜的没错……这里地下的腐化，向<style=highlight>正北</style>蔓延！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6D97134E3FC34388","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, your guess was correct. The corrupted roots underground here are spreading to the <style=\"highlight\">north</style>!","female":"Magister, your guess was correct. The corrupted roots underground here are spreading to the <style=\"highlight\">north</style>!","variant_male_record_index":"108295","variant_female_record_index":"108296","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1011512007:0":{"text":"What exactly does Eomir gain from corrupting the Lucent Tree?","source_cn":"……伊米尔腐化流荧树，究竟能得到什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D2690E3DC4B7DD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1011512008:0":{"text":"He already has influence, power, and a respected position.","source_cn":"他已经有人望，有可操控的武力，有备受尊崇的地位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61BDB26DEB59A065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1011512009:0":{"text":"Once the truth is revealed, that will tarnish his reputation and he'll lose everything.","source_cn":"真相一旦败露，他反而会身败名裂，一无所有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x389E12A5E81F7690","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1011512010:0":{"text":"Does he want to get rid of the faction system and control the Dark Forest by himself?!","source_cn":"那老头，难道看不惯三派共治，想把薄暮丛林的一切都掌握在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7975FDA2C392A8E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1011512010":{"text":"Does he want to get rid of the faction system and control the Dark Forest by himself?!","source_cn":"那老头，难道看不惯三派共治，想把薄暮丛林的一切都掌握在自己手里吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7975FDA2C392A8E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1011512012:0":{"text":"That traitor! If only we had found out what he was doing earlier...!","source_cn":"混蛋！要是我们早一点发现他在干什么就好了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35C2A797F519A079","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1011512013:1":{"text":"Lorsan, this is not the time for self-doubt. Nobody could have predicted Eomir's betrayal.","source_cn":"洛桑，现在不是自艾自怜的时候，伊米尔会做出这种事情，任...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507047CB94EE95A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1011512014:1":{"text":"What we need to do now is pull ourselves together.","source_cn":"我们现在能做的，是要打起精神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5333132B